    {
      "id": "i57ZVcm03M_fWLGE0Dngq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 604,
      "y": 201.5,
      "width": 716.719482421875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 528602782,
      "version": 817,
      "versionNonce": 1821153246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787940769173,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - publisher should allow send messages to specific topics\n    - Subscribers should follow the topics to receive messages\n    - Messages should be delivered to all subscribers of topic in real-time \n    - Can Subscriber should subscribe multiple topics ? \n\n2. Entitites:\n    - Publisher: publish the message for specific topic\n    - Subscriber: subscribe to one/more topics\n    - Topic: maintaining the subscribes\n    - Broker: manages topics , responsible for routing the msg \n    - Message: the data being published\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - publisher should allow send messages to specific topics\n    - Subscribers should follow the topics to receive messages\n    - Messages should be delivered to all subscribers of topic in real-time \n    - Can Subscriber should subscribe multiple topics ? \n\n2. Entitites:\n    - Publisher: publish the message for specific topic\n    - Subscriber: subscribe to one/more topics\n    - Topic: maintaining the subscribes\n    - Broker: manages topics , responsible for routing the msg \n    - Message: the data being published\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
